config NOMOUNT
	bool "NoMount Path Redirection Subsystem"
	default y
	help
	  NoMount allows path redirection and virtual file injection
	  without mounting filesystems. Useful for systemless modifications.
	  
	  Features:
	    - Virtual file/directory injection into any existing directory
	    - Path redirection (redirect access to a different real path)
	    - Whiteout support (hide files/directories)
	    - Per-UID blocking (block specific UIDs from seeing injected entries)
	    - Generic Netlink API for userspace management
	    - Bloom-filter accelerated child lookup
	    - Automatic virtual topology generation for non-existent paths